  "steps": [
   "Heat the oil in a large casserole over a high heat. Add the mince and fry for 8 minutes, breaking it up with a wooden spoon, until browned. Add the onion and cook for 5 minutes until soft.",
   "Stir in the garlic, curry powder and ginger and cook for 1 minute, until it smells fragrant.",
   "Add the potatoes, tomatoes, stock and salt. Bring to the boil, then cover and simmer for 15 minutes, stirring now and then.",
   "Stir in the cabbage, cover again and cook for 10 to 12 minutes, until the potatoes are tender and the cabbage is soft but still has a little bite.",
   "Stir in the cavolo nero for 3 minutes until wilted. Add the lemon juice and plenty of black pepper, then spoon into bowls and top each with a spoonful of yoghurt."
